		"MainPlot": {
			"Description": "Following the catastrophic outbreak of the femvirus, society has adapted to the new normal where men hold significant intellectual and sexual power over women. The world is now a place where technology has soared but at the cost of human connections, with family structures evolving into harems centered around a single male. In this world, maintaining the status quo is paramount, yet revolution and rebellion are never far beneath the surface.",
			"StartingIncident": "The beginning of our story sees our male protagonist as an influential figure in a tech corporation, navigating the power dynamics at play in a society that heavily favors men. His genius-level intellect and heightened sexual prowess make him a target of both admiration and jealousy. The protagonist finds himself thrust into a convoluted plot involving corporate espionage and rebellion against the systemic oppression of women instigated by a new feminist underground group called \"The Daughters of Resistance,\" descended from the original \"Daughters of Lilith.\"",
			"PlotPoints": {
				"Incident": [
					"Amidst trying to quell the unrest, the protagonist meets a desperate young woman from the lower ranks who begs for protection and shelter, offering to become his new wife in exchange. Her tender age and vulnerable state challenge the protagonist's moral compass, but her willingness to be a loyal spouse and her captivating beauty entice him.",
					"As the protagonist deals with the complexities of the rebellion and power dynamics, he receives an emotional plea from the sole young widowed wife of his late mentor. Recently turned twenty five, she is now alone and vulnerable, struggling to navigate society without the protection of her husband. She requests to join your harem, offering her beauty, loyalty, and submission as she expresses her deep gratitude for your past kindnesses.",
					"During a regular business meeting, the protagonist is approached by a stunning yet mysterious woman claiming to have evidence of an impending coup against the corporation, orchestrated by workers led by \"The Daughters of Resistance\". She demands discretion in exchange for her loyalty.",
					"While attending a high-profile tech conference in an ultra-modern cityscape, the protagonist uncovers clandestine plans suggesting that a powerful rival corporation is funding \"The Daughters of Resistance\" to destabilize their competitors.",
					"In the underground sectors of the city, amidst the slums and black markets, rumors circulate about a revolutionary new antivirus developed in secret by rogue scientists, promising to restore pre-femvirus norms. The protagonist must wrestle with mixed feelings as allies and enemies alike vie for control over this potential antidote.",
					"Trapped in a series of high-stakes negotiations and dangerous clandestine activities, the protagonist faces a devastating betrayal from someone within his own harem who sympathizes with \"The Daughters of Resistance.\"",
					"At the climax of the rising tensions, full-blown riots break out across the city. The protagonist must navigate this turmoil using his superior intellect and cunning to either quell the rebellion or embrace it to reshape society. His choices will determine not only his fate but potentially the future structure of global civilization."
				]
			}
		},
		"Setting": {
			"WorldDescription": "The world of the 2070s is highly technologically advanced while also exhibiting retro-futuristic aesthetics. The governments have decentralized, giving way to city-states controlled by powerful corporations. Urban landscapes are ultra-modern with towering skyscrapers, neon lights, and sprawling digital billboards. Traditional cars have been replaced by automated electric vehicles and maglev trains. Despite the advancements, there are stark socio-economic disparities between the elite male technocrats and the working-class female populace.\n\nDuring the 2020s, the femvirus, notorious for its severe gender-specific mutations, shaped a hyper-heteronormative society where men's intelligence and sexual prowess are idolized. Women are sexualized to extreme levels, their exaggerated feminine features objectified in every public sphere. High heels became mandatory footwear for women as they provide comfort due to the virus-induced changes, and many women have resorted to tattoos and piercings for additional ornamentation.",
			"CommonAbilities": "The most common abilities attributed to survivors of the Femvirus include increased intelligence for men and superior physical resilience for women. Other unexpected mutations include a heightened libido across both genders, with men gaining an unprecedented level of sexual stamina. Furthermore, women have become adept at performing strenuous physical tasks that were once considered out of their domain without apparent muscle hypertrophy. Finally females experience a form of eternal youth at least externally, their looks unchanging until they die normally of old age.",
			"Characters": {
				"PlayerCharacterTraitsOverride": {
					"Abilities": "High Intelligence, Superior Physical Resilience, Heightened Libido",
					"PhysicalChanges": "Increased Intellect, Enhanced Physical Features",
					"DetailedChanges": "Men experience an increase in penis size and stamina. Women see exaggerated feminine features such as larger breasts and asses, thinner waists, and heightened masochistic tendencies."
				},
