						"NamingSchema": "Common Modern Names",
						"AppeaearanceSchema": "Proportioned by virus effects: larger breasts and asses, thinner waists",
						"OtherCommonalities": "Heightened Libido, Physical Resilience, Masochistic and Submissive Tendencies. Forever young until normal natural death"
					},
					"Males": {
						"NamingSchema": "Common Modern Names",
						"AppeaearanceSchema": "Varied Features but augmented intellect and physical prowess in genitals",
						"OtherCommonalities": "Increased Intelligence, Sexual Dominance"
					}
				}
			},
			"Locations": {
				"Location": [
					"Main Cityscape: A sprawling metropolitan area filled with towering skyscrapers and dense urban development.",
					"Slums: Overpopulated areas situated at the city's edges where underprivileged women and lower-class citizens reside.",
					"High-End Residential Districts: Luxurious zones reserved for elite male technocrats and their harems.",
					"Corporate Headquarters: Grandiose buildings serving as the power centers of influential corporations.",
					"Underground Black Markets: Illicit trading hubs for contraband goods and services run by an underground network."
				]
			},
			"AbilitiesAndUncommonTermsGlossary": {
				"Term": [
					{
						"_key": "Current Population",
						"_value": "20 billion females and 2 billion males after the femvirus-induced mutations."
					},
					{
						"_key": "Modified Fertility",
						"_value": "The virus altered fertility, resulting in a ratio of 10 females to every male being conceived."
					},
					{
						"_key": "IQ Differences",
						"_value": "Post-virus men experienced an average increase of 50 IQ points, resulting in a substantial intelligence gap between the sexes."
					},
					{
						"_key": "Femvirus",
						"_value": "A virus created by the radical feminist group 'Daughters of Lilith', aimed initially to reduce the male population. Instead, it inadvertently bolstered male intelligence and virility while causing significant physical and behavioral changes in women including eternal youth. Ultimately, their goals were still partially realized as the virus shifted the balance between male and female births, resulting in 10 women being conceived for every man."
					},
					{
						"_key": "Daughters of Lilith",
						"_value": "A radical feminist group responsible for creating the Femvirus. Although their plan of drastically reducing the male population backfired, they inadvertently succeeded in achieving their ultimate goal: changing the birth ratio to favor females significantly, thus attempting to create a female-dominated world."
					},
					{
						"_key": "Modern Family Structure",
						"_value": "Marriage no longer exists. Instead, families are centered around one man, known as the 'husband,' who often works in high-tech sectors. The husband has multiple wives who call each other 'harem sisters'. Two to three harem sisters typically care for the household, while the rest work in blue-collar jobs or the service sector."
					},
					{
						"_key": "High Heels",
						"_value": "The femvirus also altered the structure of women's legs and balance centers in their brains, making high heels more comfortable and supportive than traditional footwear. As a result, high heels have become the standard footwear for women in this society."
					},
					{
						"_key": "The Great Dying",
						"_value": "In the 2020s, 90% of males died from brain aneurysms immediately following their infection with the femvirus. The remaining males experienced boosts in IQ. However, numerous women perished in the subsequent famines and infrastructure collapse as they were forcibly integrated into traditionally male job roles that involved significant risk and physical exertion."
					},
					{
						"_key": "The Great Hunt",
						"_value": "A period in the 2030s when nations around the world united to hunt down and bring members of 'The Daughters of Lilith' to justice. This radical feminist group had created the femvirus, which turned civilization on its head. Fueled by retribution for the chaos and death caused, global task forces and independent bounty hunters scoured the globe in search of these women. Many members of the organization were captured, tried, and executed, while others went into hiding or changed identities to survive. This event significantly crippled the operation and influence of 'The Daughters of Lilith.'"
					},
					{
						"_key": "Eternal Youth",
						"_value": "Women who survived the femvirus gained an unexpected advantage: eternal youth. As a side effect of the virus's hormonal alterations, females no longer experience visible aging after reaching peak physical maturity. While their internal aging process continues normally, externally they maintain their youthful appearances until their natural deaths. These women keep their soft and supple skin, firm breasts, tight waists, and overall attractive physiques indefinitely, which has further cemented the extreme objectification and sexualization in this altered society."
					}
				]
			}
		}
